offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198030084229/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 1626, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 361, "last_played": 1714151159, "avatar": "0236100f2ee8262b54eb0799f7a880c3d5dfa909"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty nice rogue-like. Recommended", "timestamp_created": 1697400400, "timestamp_updated": 1697400400, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "148296531", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048827051", "personaname": "Kyle'Thuzad", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048827051/", "num_games_owned": 310, "num_reviews": 89, "playtime_forever": 7502, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6354, "last_played": 1786850329, "avatar": "f4f2fc58620a769dfcc51defda89ed5cb8fa7d75"}, "language": "english", "review": "Critter borderlands. 10/10. \n\nThe progressive difficulty modfifiers for runs start to get stale right when the Reincarnation system comes into play, which lets you add more roguelike run and meta progression, more paths to power, and gamechanging mechanics, many of which you can just toggle. \n\nLooter shooter with very unique weapons, characters, and modifiers. You can literally become sonic the hedgehog if you build right. Or I guess Shadow because guns?", "timestamp_created": 1697395295, "timestamp_updated": 1697395295, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "148268332", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006834126", "personaname": "nice.nice.nice", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nice-nice-nice/", "num_games_owned": 990, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 11649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 12, "playtime_at_review": 5756, "last_played": 1789853514, "avatar": "2378cddb69ffc646f05c77b9e74cfa0f7565dc37"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fantastic game and I absolutely recommend it!!\n\nYou enter dungeons, shoot, loot and upgrade, repeat. You think you are doing great, beat the first few difficulties, feel like you can build your character the best way, then you reach REINCARNATION.\n\nAt this point, the game genuinely feels like a whole new game, where you still have the option to add the options! The core game is still the same but there are so many builds and strategies to choose from.\n\nThe choice of characters, guns and builds is great and the first lot of DLC added so much more.\nShooting/attacking is crispy and I have NEVER experienced any performance issues, lag or errors.\n\nMatchmaking is a little slow but join the discord to get a group and good luck with R9!\n\nUpdate #1: Thought I would update this review after Season 2 released. Still an incredible game, think I'm actually getting better. More scrolls and mechanics keep adding to the experience!", "timestamp_created": 1697365428, "timestamp_updated": 1715149999, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}